# Call-site exhaustiveness: passing an arg that matches no typed bucket (and no rest exists)
# produces a type warning at the call site. The type checker warns; try catches the runtime error.
[call [fn [let]
  [f: [fn [let ...ss@String ...ns@Int] ss]]
  [r: [try [fn [] [f 3.14]]]]
  [match r
    [Result.Error p]: 1
    [Result.Ok p]:    0]]]
=== out
Int(1)

=== warn
argument type Float does not match any variadic bucket
